<title>CHINA: China wheat imports down by 82.9 pct in Jan-June.</title>
<headline>China wheat imports down by 82.9 pct in Jan-June.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 840,000 tonnes of wheat in the first half of the year, down by 82.9 percent compared with the same period of 1996, the China Securities newspaper said on Wednesday, quoting customs figures.</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-JUNE	JUNE     H1 YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Wheat   840,000		30,000	-82.9</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
